# Regenerated on every run by RequestUtils.setupRest(), which mkdir -p's and
# rewrites it unconditionally — so CI's first run is unaffected by its absence.
# Tracking it meant a live admin cookie and REST nonce in git, and a checkout's
# stale nonce 403ing a run's first few calls.
artifacts/storage-states/

# Model mirror staging (Task 1 — large binaries, never committed)
pocket-tts-onnx-mirror-src/

# Agent scratch (SDD ledger, briefs, review packages)
.superpowers/

# Isolated worktrees for plan execution (superpowers:using-git-worktrees)
.worktrees/

